            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 7,
        "ActionId": 7,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "\"I can recount how those around me fell to the red claws of the Punishing Virus,",
            "ffffffff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory0.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 8,
        "ActionId": 8,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "or how those in the medical tents, trembling on the brink of death, left their final words.\"",
            "ffffffff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory0.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 9,
        "ActionId": 9,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "\"Or I can tell you about a piece of paper I picked up, written in childish handwriting, with a girl's last wish of leaving a cake at home for her mother,",
            "ffffffff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory0.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "and the torn cloth on her body for her father, though her parents and home had long been engulfed by the Punishing Virus.\"",
            "ffffffff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory0.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "\"Suffering and struggle have painted the backdrop of our history. Countless words have been written to document suffering over thousands of years.",
            "ffffffff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory0.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "However, the only meaning of suffering is to awaken our resolve to fight on and continue living.\"",
            "ffffffff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory0.png",
            "",
            1,
            1,
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 13,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "\"Beyond that, suffering carries no meaning.\"",
            "ffffffff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory0.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            1,
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "\"Thus, I refuse to document suffering. I feel sorrow for those tormented by it; they are my people.",
            "ffffffff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory0.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "But I also refuse to let my pen document a history steeped in the suffering of my people. This is my last shred of conscience.\"",
            "ffffffff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory0.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
            "\"...When only a few Constructs could fight alongside us, they nearly paved the way with their own flesh and blood.",
            "ffffffff",
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Texture/Image/BgStory/BgStory0.png",
            "",
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 304,
        "Params": [
